<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss six-month money claims yield 1.660 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss six-month money claims yield 1.660 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield on the latest issue of Swiss federal government six-month money market claims has been set at 1.660 percent, the federal treasury in Berne said.</p>
<p>The 6.377 issue, to be paid for on March 13, raised 799.25 million francs and was priced at 99.168 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
